    <ReportSection>
      <Body>
        <ReportItems>
          <Textbox Name="Textbox12">
            <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
            <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>The above named person is our </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>Member number</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value xml:space="preserve"> </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!MemberNo_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>.  He/She has informed us that he intends to stand surety for his </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!Accused_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>, who is an accused person at </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!CourtName_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>, Criminal Case No. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!CaseNo_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>-</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>Republic versus  </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!Accused_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> on the strength of shares he/she has with us amounting to  </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!NumberText.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value> shillings only (Kshs. </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!Amount_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>/=) </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>as at  </Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>=First(Fields!Date_SuretyManagement.Value, "DataSet_Result")</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <Format>d</Format>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>.
 
He/She has given us an undertaking that he/she shall not withdraw his shares from the Society as long as the criminal case subsists.

We wish to inform you therefore that we have no objection to the same.  On our part, we shall ensure that the member does not withdraw his/her shares from the Society until we get clearance from your end that the case has been heard and determined and the member’s shares cleared herein.

Kindly note to keep us appraised on the progress.

Yours faithfully,



CH</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>IEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                      <TextDecoration>Underline</TextDecoration>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value xml:space="preserve">
</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontSize>12pt</FontSize>
                    </Style>
                  </TextRun>
                </TextRuns>
                <Style />
              </Paragraph>
            </Paragraphs>
